---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — Beyond Panama Relocation"
  description="Reach out to start planning your move to Panama. WhatsApp, email, or schedule a call — we respond within 24 hours."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mt-4 mb-3">Let's talk about your move to Panama</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-lg max-w-2xl">
        No automated replies, no sales funnels. You'll hear from a real person who has lived through this process — usually within a day.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 ways to connect -->
    <div class="space-y-6 mb-14">

      <!-- WhatsApp — primary CTA -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/25 p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-6">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide">Best way to reach us</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mt-1 mb-2">WhatsApp</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm max-w-md">
            Send a quick message with your situation and questions. We'll respond the same day (Mon–Fri) and figure out if we're a good fit before anything else.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/50766060000"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-4 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-base hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/>
          </svg>
          Message us on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Email -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/10 p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide">Email</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mt-1 mb-1">Prefer email?</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">Works great for longer questions or if you'd like to attach documents.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="mailto:hola@beyondpanamarelocation.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-jade/25 text-jade font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade/5 transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          hola@beyondpanamarelocation.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Schedule a call — coming soon -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/10 p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4 opacity-70">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide">Video call</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mt-1 mb-1">Schedule a call</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">30-minute consultation via Zoom or Google Meet. Start with WhatsApp and we'll book a time from there.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-3 rounded-full border border-jade/15 text-slate-mid text-sm shrink-0">
          Calendly coming soon
        </span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- What to expect -->
    <div class="mb-14 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 p-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-6">What happens after you reach out</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-jade font-serif text-xl leading-none mt-0.5">1</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-slate font-medium">You'll hear back within 24 hours</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mt-0.5">Usually much sooner. We read every message personally and reply the same day during the week.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-jade font-serif text-xl leading-none mt-0.5">2</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-slate font-medium">First conversation is free — always</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mt-0.5">We'll figure out your situation, answer your initial questions, and tell you honestly whether we can help.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-jade font-serif text-xl leading-none mt-0.5">3</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-slate font-medium">No pressure, no hard sell</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mt-0.5">If we're not the right fit for your situation, we'll say so and point you toward resources that are. That's it.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Things to think about before reaching out -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">Things worth thinking about first</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-6 max-w-2xl">
        You don't need to have all the answers before writing. But these are the questions we'll ask early, so having a rough idea helps us give better guidance from the start.
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-jade/10 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Nationality / country of origin</p>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">This shapes which visa options apply to you and what documents you'll need.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-jade/10 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Target timeframe</p>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">Are you thinking 3 months, 1 year, or just exploring? Even a rough horizon helps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-jade/10 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Main motivation</p>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">Retirement, remote work, family, investment, lower cost of living — or a mix of several.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-jade/10 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-jade uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Your biggest question or concern</p>
          <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm">Whatever is making you hesitate or keeping you up at night — that's where we'll start.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer nudge -->
    <div class="text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Not sure where to start?</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-5">Take the quick quiz and we'll tell you which path fits your situation best.</p>
      <a href="/en/quiz" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">
        Take the quiz →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
